        <type>u32</type>
        <definition>u32 DsiPath_StartVideo</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>DsiPath_StartVideo</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Activate the DSI TX Subsystem so it streams whatever video is currently presented on its AXI4-Stream input (the VPSS scaler&apos;s output once the AXI4-Stream Switch is steered to the DSI path). </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Call this LAST, only once the caller has already rebuilt and started the upstream sensor/CSI/scaler chain (see DsiPath_Reinit()).</para><para><simplesect kind="return"><para>XST_SUCCESS or XST_FAILURE.</para></simplesect>
Activate the DSI TX Subsystem so it streams whatever video is currently presented on its AXI4-Stream input (the VPSS scaler&apos;s output once the AXI4-Stream Switch is steered to the DSI path).</para><para>Call this LAST, only once the upstream sensor/CSI/scaler chain has already been rebuilt and started by the caller (see DsiPath_Reinit()) — matches the ZCU102 reference&apos;s <ref refid="pipeline__program_8c_1acd55ed8c8232ae426bf8d3d578e03741" kindref="member">EnableDSI()</ref>, which is likewise called only after CamReset()/EnableCSI()/ <ref refid="pipeline__program_8c_1a9909ac1b3c8acfa727d8b5d0bd7eda39" kindref="member">SetupCameraSensor()</ref>/StartSensor() have all completed. </para>        </detaileddescription>
