      <memberdef kind="function" id="xmipi__scu200__xp5io__example_2dsi__txss__display_8h_1a9656bb8bc26fd48353098543d440b152" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void DsiPath_StopVideo</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>DsiPath_StopVideo</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Deactivate the DSI TX Subsystem. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Call this first, whenever DSI is about to stop being the active output, or in preparation for DsiPath_Reinit().</para><para>Call this first, whenever DSI is about to stop being the active output (or right before DsiPath_Reinit(), to prepare for re-entering DSI) — matches the ZCU102 reference&apos;s <ref refid="function__prototype_8c_1ae229cb3a71466b40c2ac44019d6a1795" kindref="member">DisableDSI()</ref>, which is always called before its <ref refid="function__prototype_8c_1a571466dbec30928cd622090965a7ef0f" kindref="member">InitDSI()</ref> reset step. </para>        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
